hadiths[count]{hadithnumber,text}:
"213","Narrated by Abd al-Jabbar ibn al-Alaa. Narrated by Sufyan. He said: We preserved him from al-Zuhri. Abu Salamah informed us on the authority of Aisha. She said: “The Messenger of If God, may God bless him and grant him peace, wanted to sleep while he was in a state of junub, he should perform his ablution for prayer.”"
